alue></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/raideur_nuque-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/raideur_nuque-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/nez_coule-label\">\n            <value>Manana tsifotra ve ny zaza?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/nez_coule-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/nez_coule-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/cause_palu-label\">\n            <value>Efa tratran'ny antony hafa mahatonga tazomoka ve ny zaza?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/cause_palu-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/cause_palu-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-ARETINA TAZO TENA MAFY**\n* Omeo art\u00e9sunate na kinina (ampanga voalohany) ho an\u2019ny tazomoka mafy raha TDR(+)\n* Omeo ny ampanga voalohany amin\u2019ny antibiotika sahaza\n* Tsaboina ny zaza mba hisorohana ny hypoglyc\u00e9mie\n* Omeo parac\u00e9tamol ao amin\u2019ny tobim-pahasalamana raha avo ny hafanana (38,5\u00b0C na mihoatra)\n* Afindra MAIKA any amin\u2019ny hopitaly</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-ARETINA TAZO TENA MAFY**\n* Omeo art\u00e9sunate na kinina (ampanga voalohany) ho an\u2019ny tazomoka mafy raha TDR(+)\n* Omeo ny ampanga voalohany amin\u2019ny antibiotika sahaza\n* Tsaboina ny zaza mba hisorohana ny hypoglyc\u00e9mie\n* Omeo parac\u00e9tamol ao amin\u2019ny tobim-pahasalamana raha avo ny hafanana (38,5\u00b0C na mihoatra)\n* Afindra MAIKA any amin\u2019ny hopitaly</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/label_diag_pneumonie-label\">\n            <value>### **-TAZOMOKA**\n* Omeo ny fanafody antimalaria am-bava voalohany natolotra\n* Omeo parac\u00e9tamol ao amin\u2019ny tobim-pahasalamana raha avo ny hafanana (38,5\u00b0C na mihoatra)\n* Omeo fitsaboana antibiotika sahaza raha hita fa avy amin\u2019ny aretina bakteria ny hafanana\n* Hazavao amin\u2019ny reny ny fotoana tokony hiverenany avy hatrany\n* Diniho indray ny zaza afaka 3 andro raha mbola mitohy ny hafanana\n* Raha naharitra 7 andro misesy ny hafanana, afindra mba hanaovana fanadihadiana fanampiny</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-TAZOMOKA**\n* Omeo ny fanafody antimalaria am-bava voalohany natolotra\n* Omeo parac\u00e9tamol ao amin\u2019ny tobim-pahasalamana raha avo ny hafanana (38,5\u00b0C na mihoatra)\n* Omeo fitsaboana antibiotika sahaza raha hita fa avy amin\u2019ny aretina bakteria ny hafanana\n* Hazavao amin\u2019ny reny ny fotoana tokony hiverenany avy hatrany\n* Diniho indray ny zaza afaka 3 andro raha mbola mitohy ny hafanana\n* Raha naharitra 7 andro misesy ny hafanana, afindra mba hanaovana fanadihadiana fanampiny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/stock/distribuer_artesu-label\">\n            <value>Hizara ARTESUNATE ve ianao ?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/stock/distribuer_artesu-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/stock/distribuer_artesu-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/stock/quantite_distribuee_artesu-label\">\n            <value>Isan'ny ARTESUNATE nozaraina :</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question4/stock/quantite_distribuee_artesu-constraintMsg\">\n         