value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/douleur_oreille/pus_oreille-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/douleur_oreille/nombre_jour_ecoulement_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Isan\u2019ny andro</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/douleur_oreille/gonflement_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Manana fivontosana maharary ao ambadiky ny sofin\u2019ny zaza ve?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/douleur_oreille/gonflement_oreille-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/douleur_oreille/gonflement_oreille-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/label_diag_pas_infection-label\">\n            <value>### **-TSY MISY ARETINA AMIN\u2019NY SOFINA**\n* Tsy misy fitsaboana</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-TSY MISY ARETINA AMIN\u2019NY SOFINA**\n* Tsy misy fitsaboana</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/label_diag_infection_chronique_oreille-label\">\n            <value>### **-ARETINA MAHARITRA AMIN\u2019NY SOFINA**\n* Amainina ny sofina amin\u2019ny fampiasana m\u00e8che\n* Tsaboina amin\u2019ny ranon-javatra misy quinolone ampiasaina amin\u2019ny sofina mandritra ny 14 andro\n* Hazavao amin\u2019ny reny ny fotoana tokony hiverenany avy hatrany\n* Diniho ny zaza indray afaka 5 andro</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-ARETINA MAHARITRA AMIN\u2019NY SOFINA**\n* Amainina ny sofina amin\u2019ny fampiasana m\u00e8che\n* Tsaboina amin\u2019ny ranon-javatra misy quinolone ampiasaina amin\u2019ny sofina mandritra ny 14 andro\n* Hazavao amin\u2019ny reny ny fotoana tokony hiverenany avy hatrany\n* Diniho ny zaza indray afaka 5 andro</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/label_diag_infection_aigue_oreille-label\">\n            <value>### **-ARETINA MAHERY VAIKA AMIN\u2019NY SOFINA**\n* **Manomeza antibiotika mandritra ny 5 andro**\n* **Manomeza paracetamol hampitoniana ny fanaintainana**\n* Amainina ny sofina amin\u2019ny fampiasana lamba m\u00e8che\n* Hazavao amin\u2019ny reny ny fotoana tokony hiverenany avy hatrany\n* Diniho ny zaza indray afaka 5 andro</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-ARETINA MAHERY VAIKA AMIN\u2019NY SOFINA**\n* **Manomeza antibiotika mandritra ny 5 andro**\n* **Manomeza paracetamol hampitoniana ny fanaintainana**\n* Amainina ny sofina amin\u2019ny fampiasana lamba m\u00e8che\n* Hazavao amin\u2019ny reny ny fotoana tokony hiverenany avy hatrany\n* Diniho ny zaza indray afaka 5 andro</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/label_referer_mastoide-label\">\n            <value>### **-MASTOIDITA**\n* Omeo ny fatra voalohany amin\u2019ny antibiotika sahaza\n* Omeo ny fatra voalohany amin\u2019ny paracetamol hampitoniana ny fanaintainana\n* Afindra haingana any amin\u2019ny hopitaly</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MASTOIDITA**\n* Omeo ny fatra voalohany amin\u2019ny antibiotika sahaza\n* Omeo ny fatra voalohany amin\u2019ny paracetamol hampitoniana ny fanaintainana\n* Afindra haingana any amin\u2019ny hopitaly</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/stock/distribuer_para-label\">\n            <value>Hizara PARACETAMOL ve ianao ?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/stock/distribuer_para-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/stock/distribuer_para-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/stock/quantite_distribuee_para-label\">\n            <value>Isan'ny PARACETAMOL nozaraina :</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/question6/stock/quantite_distribuee_para-constraintMsg\">\n            <value>Ny isa dia tsy maintsy mihoatra ny 0.</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition-label\">\n            <value>TSIFANJARIANTSAKAFO</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/pesee_enfant-label\">\n            <value>Fandrefesana ny lanjan'ny zaza</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/pesee_enfant/prepa_avant_pesee-label\">\n            <value>**Fiomanana alohan\u2019ny fandrefesana ny lanja :**\n*Mila olona roa mba handrefesana lanja ny zaza.\n* Omano daholo ny fitaovana ilaina: mizana, hamac, tohana, registre, karinem-pahasalamana.\n* Raha mitomany na mihetsiketsika ny zaza mandritra ny fandrefesana ny lanja, dia atao miato ny mizana ary miandrasa vetivety mandra-pionon\u2019ny zaza mba ahafahana manoratra ny lanjany.</value><value form=\"markdown\">**Fiomanana alohan\u2019ny fandrefesana ny lanja :**\n*Mila olona roa mba handrefesana lanja ny zaza.\n* Omano daholo ny fitaovana ilaina: mizana, hamac, tohana, registre, karinem-pahasalamana.\n* Raha mitomany na mihetsiketsika ny zaza mandritra ny fandrefesana ny lanja, dia atao miato ny mizana ary miandrasa vetivety mandra-pionon\u2019ny zaza mba ahafahana manoratra ny lanjany.</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/pesee_enfant/poids-label\">\n            <value>**Lanjao** ny zaza ary **omeo** ny lanjany (kg):</value><value form=\"markdown\">**Lanjao** ny zaza ary **omeo** ny lanjany (kg):</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/pesee_enfant/poids-hint\">\n            <value>* Avereno ho 0 ny fanondron'ny fandanjana  isaky ny handanja zaza iray ianao*</value><value form=\"markdown\">* Avereno ho 0 ny fanondron'ny fandanjana  isaky ny handanja zaza iray ianao*</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes-label\">\n            <value>Fandrefesana ny refin-tsandry</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/etapes_pb-label\">\n            <value>**Dingana/Asa harahina :**\n1. Manomana ny fitaovana (MUAC, penina)\n2. Miarahaba ny reny tonga\n3. Manazava amin\u2019ny reny ny ho atao ary maka ny fankatoavany sy ny\nfanampiany\n4. Mangataka ny reny hiampofo ny zaza ary esorina ny tanan\u2019akanjo\nhavia,\n5. Mandray ny tanana havian\u2019 ilay zaza\n6. Mamoritra ny kiho havia ny zaza atao mahitsy zoro\n7. Mitady ny lohan\u2019ny soroka sy ny tendron\u2019ny kiho\n8. Mametraka eo amin\u2019ny lohan\u2019ny soroka ny tondro manambara ny aotra amin\u2019ilay fandrefesana\n9. Manatsotra manaraka ny sandry hatreo ambanin\u2019ny lohan\u2019ny kiho ny fandrefesana.\n10. Mamaky ny refy azo ary zaraina 2 itadiavana ny afovoany ny sandry\n11. Marihina amin\u2019ny penina ny afovoan\u2019ny sandry\n12. Manatsotra ny tanan\u2019ny zaza ary mametraka manodidina ny sandry ilay fandrefesana ary ampandalovina tandrifin\u2019ilay marika.\n13. Manamarina tsara fa antonony ny fihenjanan\u2019ny fandrefesana : tsy goragora ary tsy mihenjana.\n14. Mamaky amin\u2019ny milimetatra ny tarehimarika mifanandrify eo amin\u2019ny tondro roa</value><value form=\"markdown\">**Dingana/Asa harahina :**\n1. Manomana ny fitaovana (MUAC, penina)\n2. Miarahaba ny reny tonga\n3. Manazava amin\u2019ny reny ny ho atao ary maka ny fankatoavany sy ny\nfanampiany\n4. Mangataka ny reny hiampofo ny zaza ary esorina ny tanan\u2019akanjo\nhavia,\n5. Mandray ny tanana havian\u2019 ilay zaza\n6. Mamoritra ny kiho havia ny zaza atao mahitsy zoro\n7. Mitady ny lohan\u2019ny soroka sy ny tendron\u2019ny kiho\n8. Mametraka eo amin\u2019ny lohan\u2019ny soroka ny tondro manambara ny aotra amin\u2019ilay fandrefesana\n9. Manatsotra manaraka ny sandry hatreo ambanin\u2019ny lohan\u2019ny kiho ny fandrefesana.\n10. Mamaky ny refy azo ary zaraina 2 itadiavana ny afovoany ny sandry\n11. Marihina amin\u2019ny penina ny afovoan\u2019ny sandry\n12. Manatsotra ny tanan\u2019ny zaza ary mametraka manodidina ny sandry ilay fandrefesana ary ampandalovina tandrifin\u2019ilay marika.\n13. Manamarina tsara fa antonony ny fihenjanan\u2019ny fandrefesana : tsy goragora ary tsy mihenjana.\n14. Mamaky amin\u2019ny milimetatra ny tarehimarika mifanandrify eo amin\u2019ny tondro roa</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/etapes_pb-ok-label\">\n            <value>OK</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/mesure_pb-label\">\n            <value>Refi-tsandry (mm):</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/mesure_pb-constraintMsg\">\n            <value>### Tokony ho eo anelanelan\u2019ny 100 sy 130 mm ny PB!</value><value form=\"markdown\">### Tokony ho eo anelanelan\u2019ny 100 sy 130 mm ny PB!</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/oedeme-label\">\n            <value>Misy fivontosana ve ?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/oedeme-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/oedeme-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/amaigrissement_visible-label\">\n            <value>Hita maso sy mahery vaika ve ny fahamaizan\u2019ny zaza ?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/amaigrissement_visible-oui-label\">\n            <value>Eny</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/amaigrissement_visible-non-label\">\n            <value>Tsia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/signe_de_complication-label\">\n            <value>Famantarana fahasarotana</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/signe_de_complication/incapable_finir_apte-label\">\n            <value>Tsy afaka mamita ny ATPE?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb_etapes/signe_de_complicati