nseils sur la suppl\u00e9mentation en vitamine A**</value><value form=\"markdown\">## **Conseils sur la suppl\u00e9mentation en vitamine A**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/autres/autre_problme-label\">\n            <value>Autres probl\u00e8mes?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/autres/autre_problme-oui-label\">\n            <value>Oui</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/autres/autre_problme-non-label\">\n            <value>Non</value></text>\n          <text id=\"classification-label\">\n            <value>CLASSIFICATION</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference-label\">\n            <value>MESSAGE DE REFERENCE</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/image_reference-label\">\n            <value>**VEUILLEZ REFERER LE PATIENT IMMEDIATEMENT!!!**</value><value form=\"markdown\">**VEUILLEZ REFERER LE PATIENT IMMEDIATEMENT!!!**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/motifs-label\">\n            <value>MOTIF(S) :</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/copy-2-of-label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-MALADIE F\u00c9BRILE TR\u00c8S GRAVE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MALADIE F\u00c9BRILE TR\u00c8S GRAVE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/un_signe_de_danger_a_t_dtect_veuillez_rfrer_le_patient_immdiatement-label\">\n            <value>### **Un ou plusieurs signes de danger d\u00e9tect\u00e9(s)!!**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Un ou plusieurs signes de danger d\u00e9tect\u00e9(s)!!**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-PNEUMONIE S\u00c9V\u00c8RE OU MALADIE TR\u00c8S GRAVE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-PNEUMONIE S\u00c9V\u00c8RE OU MALADIE TR\u00c8S GRAVE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_diarrhee_deshyd_legere-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRH\u00c9E AVEC D\u00c9SHYDRATATION L\u00c9G\u00c8RE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRH\u00c9E AVEC D\u00c9SHYDRATATION L\u00c9G\u00c8RE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_diarrhee_deshyd_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRH\u00c9E AVEC D\u00c9SHYDRATATION S\u00c9V\u00c8RE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRH\u00c9E AVEC D\u00c9SHYDRATATION S\u00c9V\u00c8RE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_diarrhee_persitante_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRH\u00c9E PERSISTANTE S\u00c9V\u00c8RE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRH\u00c9E PERSISTANTE S\u00c9V\u00c8RE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_mastoide-label\">\n            <value>### **-MASTO\u00cfDITE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MASTO\u00cfDITE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_malnutrition_severe_complication-label\">\n            <value>### **-MALNUTRITION AIGU\u00cb S\u00c9V\u00c8RE AVEC COMPLICATIONS**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MALNUTRITION AIGU\u00cb S\u00c9V\u00c8RE AVEC COMPLICATIONS**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/copy-1-of-label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-AN\u00c9MIE GRAVE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-AN\u00c9MIE GRAVE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_diag_absence_carnet_vaccin-label\">\n            <value>### **-PAS DE CARNET DE VACCINATION**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-PAS DE CARNET DE VACCINATION**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_diag_pas_a_jour_vaccin-label\">\n            <value>### **-PAS A JOUR SUR SES VACCINATIONS**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-PAS A JOUR SUR SES VACCINATIONS**</value></text>\n        </translation>\n        <translation lang=\"en\">\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge-label\">\n            <value>PRISE EN CHARGE</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/date_pec-label\">\n            <value>Date de prise en charge</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/date_pec-constraintMsg\">\n            <value>D\u00e9sol\u00e9 la date de consultation ne peut pas \u00eatre dans le future .</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-label\">\n            <value>Reason for the visit</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-motif_toux-label\">\n            <value>Cough / breathing difficulty</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-motif_fievre-label\">\n            <value>Fever / Hot body</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-diarrhe-label\">\n            <value>Diarrhea</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-motif_douleur_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Ear pain</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-malnutrition-label\">\n            <value>Malnutrition</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-anemie-label\">\n            <value>Anemia</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/motif_de_la_visite/motif_visite-autre-label\">\n            <value>Other</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger-label\">\n            <value>General danger signs</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/incapable_boire_teter-label\">\n            <value>Is the child unable to drink or breastfeed?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/incapable_boire_teter-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/incapable_boire_teter-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/vomit_tout-label\">\n            <value>Does the child vomit everything they consume?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/vomit_tout-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/vomit_tout-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/convulsion-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have (or recently had) convulsions?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/convulsion-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/convulsion-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/lethargie_inconscient-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have lethargy or is unconscious (very tired or unresponsive)?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/lethargie_inconscient-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/lethargie_inconscient-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/signes_generaux_danger/un_signe_de_danger_a_t_dtect_veuillez_rfrer_le_patient_immdiatement-label\">\n            <value>### **One or more danger signs detected!!**\n* Administer diazepam if the child is currently having seizures\n* Complete the evaluation quickly\n* Provide any necessary pre-transfer treatment immediately\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **One or more danger signs detected!!**\n* Administer diazepam if the child is currently having seizures\n* Complete the evaluation quickly\n* Provide any necessary pre-transfer treatment immediately\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires-label\">\n            <value>TOUX ET DIFFICUT\u00c9S RESPIRATOIRES</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/toux-label\">\n            <value>Is the child coughing?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/toux-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/toux-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/nombre_jours_toux-label\">\n            <value>Number of days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/difficulte_respiratoire-label\">\n            <value>L\u2019enfant a-t \u2019il des difficult\u00e9s respiratoires ?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/difficulte_respiratoire-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/difficulte_respiratoire-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/nombre_jour_difficulte_respiratoire-label\">\n            <value>Number of days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/contact_tuberculeux-label\">\n            <value>Has the child recently been in contact with someone with tuberculosis?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/contact_tuberculeux-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/contact_tuberculeux-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/stridor-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have stridor?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/stridor-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/stridor-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/tirage_sous-costal-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have subcostal retraction?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/tirage_sous-costal-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/tirage_sous-costal-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/respiration_sifflante_bruyante-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have wheezing (noisy breathing)?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/respiration_sifflante_bruyante-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/respiration_sifflante_bruyante-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/respiration_minute-label\">\n            <value>Number of breaths per minute:</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_resp_rapide-label\">\n            <value>**The breathing of <output value=\"instance('casedb')/casedb/case[@case_id = instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id]/prenom_nom\"/> is rapid**.</value><value form=\"markdown\">**The breathing of <output value=\"instance('casedb')/casedb/case[@case_id = instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id]/prenom_nom\"/> is rapid**.</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE PNEUMONIA OR VERY SEVERE DISEASE**\n* Administer the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm\n* URGENTLY transfer to the hospital**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE PNEUMONIA OR VERY SEVERE DISEASE**\n* Administer the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm\n* URGENTLY transfer to the hospital**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie-label\">\n            <value>### **-PNEUMONIA**\n* Administer oral amoxicillin for 5 days***\n* In case of wheezing (even if the wheezing has disappeared after the administration of a fast-acting bronchodilator), administer an inhaled bronchodilator for 5 days\n* In case of chest indrawing in a child exposed to or infected with HIV, give a first dose of amoxicillin and refer.\n* Relieve sore throat and soothe the cough with a harmless remedy\n* If the cough lasts more than 14 days or if there is recurrent wheezing, refer for possible tuberculosis or asthma evaluation. \n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow up in 3 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-PNEUMONIA**\n* Administer oral amoxicillin for 5 days***\n* In case of wheezing (even if the wheezing has disappeared after the administration of a fast-acting bronchodilator), administer an inhaled bronchodilator for 5 days\n* In case of chest indrawing in a child exposed to or infected with HIV, give a first dose of amoxicillin and refer.\n* Relieve sore throat and soothe the cough with a harmless remedy\n* If the cough lasts more than 14 days or if there is recurrent wheezing, refer for possible tuberculosis or asthma evaluation. \n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow up in 3 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_toux-label\">\n            <value>### **-COUGH OR COLD**\n* In case of wheezing (even if the wheezing has disappeared after the administration of a fast-acting bronchodilator), administer an inhaled bronchodilator for 5 days\n* Relieve sore throat and soothe the cough with a harmless remedy\n* If the cough lasts more than 14 days or if there is recurrent wheezing, refer for possible tuberculosis or asthma evaluation\n* Perform nasal washing (in case of nasal discharge)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow up in 5 days if no improvement</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-COUGH OR COLD**\n* In case of wheezing (even if the wheezing has disappeared after the administration of a fast-acting bronchodilator), administer an inhaled bronchodilator for 5 days\n* Relieve sore throat and soothe the cough with a harmless remedy\n* If the cough lasts more than 14 days or if there is recurrent wheezing, refer for possible tuberculosis or asthma evaluation\n* Perform nasal washing (in case of nasal discharge)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow up in 5 days if no improvement</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees-label\">\n            <value>DIARRHEES</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/diarrhe_selle_molle-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have diarrhea (3 or more loose stools per day)?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/diarrhe_selle_molle-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/diarrhe_selle_molle-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/nombre_jour_diarrhee-label\">\n            <value>Number of days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/sang_selle-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have blood in their stools?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/sang_selle-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/sang_selle-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group-label\">\n            <value>**SIGNS OF DEHYDRATION**</value><value form=\"markdown\">**SIGNS OF DEHYDRATION**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/signes_de_dehydratation-label\">\n            <value>Signs of dehydration</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/signes_de_dehydratation-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/signes_de_dehydratation-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/lethargie_inconscient-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have lethargy or is unconscious (very tired or not responding)?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/lethargie_inconscient-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/lethargie_inconscient-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/yeux_enfonce-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have sunken eyes?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/yeux_enfonce-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/yeux_enfonce-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/assoiffe-label\">\n            <value>Is the child thirsty / drinking eagerly?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/assoiffe-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/assoiffe-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/boit_difficilement-label\">\n            <value>Is the child unable to drink or drinking with difficulty?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/boit_difficilement-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/boit_difficilement-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/pincer_la_peau_de_labdomen-label\">\n            <value>Pinch the skin of the child's abdomen and see if the skin fold disappears:\n\n* Very slowly (more than 2 seconds)?\n* Slowly?</value><value form=\"markdown\">Pinch the skin of the child's abdomen and see if the skin fold disappears:\n\n* Very slowly (more than 2 seconds)?\n* Slowly?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/plis_cutane_lent-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have skin folds disappearing slowly?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/plis_cutane_lent-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/plis_cutane_lent-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/plis_cutane_tres_lent-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have skin folds disappearing very slowly?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/plis_cutane_tres_lent-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/plis_cutane_tres_lent-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/agite-label\">\n            <value>Is the child restless, irritable?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/agite-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/signe_gravite_group/agite-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_diag_diarrhee_sans_deshyd-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRHEA WITHOUT DEHYDRATION**\n* Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat diarrhea at home (Plan A)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days if no improvement</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRHEA WITHOUT DEHYDRATION**\n* Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat diarrhea at home (Plan A)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days if no improvement</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_diag_diarrhee_deshyd_legere-label\">\n            <value>### **-Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat mild dehydration (Plan B)**\n* Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat mild dehydration (Plan B)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days if no improvement</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat mild dehydration (Plan B)**\n* Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat mild dehydration (Plan B)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days if no improvement</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_referer_diarrhee_deshyd_legere-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRHEA WITH MILD DEHYDRATION**\n* **Urgently transfer to the hospital, with the mother frequently giving sips of ORS on the way**\n* **Advise the mother to continue breastfeeding**\n* Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat mild dehydration (Plan B)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days if no improvement</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRHEA WITH MILD DEHYDRATION**\n* **Urgently transfer to the hospital, with the mother frequently giving sips of ORS on the way**\n* **Advise the mother to continue breastfeeding**\n* Provide fluids, zinc supplements, and food to treat mild dehydration (Plan B)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days if no improvement</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_diag_diarrhee_persitante_legere-label\">\n            <value>### **-PERSISTENT DIARRHEA WITHOUT DEHYDRATION**\n* Explain to the mother how to feed a child with PERSISTENT DIARRHEA\n* Provide multivitamins and trace elements for 14 days, Zinc for 10 days, and Vitamin A as treatment\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-PERSISTENT DIARRHEA WITHOUT DEHYDRATION**\n* Explain to the mother how to feed a child with PERSISTENT DIARRHEA\n* Provide multivitamins and trace elements for 14 days, Zinc for 10 days, and Vitamin A as treatment\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 5 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_diag_dysenterie-label\">\n            <value>### **-DYSENTERY**\n* Treat dehydration\n* Administer ciprofloxacin for 3 days (if dysentery with fever)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 3 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DYSENTERY**\n* Treat dehydration\n* Administer ciprofloxacin for 3 days (if dysentery with fever)\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review in 3 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_diag_diarrhee_deshyd_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRHEA WITH SEVERE DEHYDRATION**\n* Provide fluids for severe dehydration (Plan C)\n* If the child is 2 years or older and there is a cholera outbreak in the area, administer an antibiotic for cholera</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRHEA WITH SEVERE DEHYDRATION**\n* Provide fluids for severe dehydration (Plan C)\n* If the child is 2 years or older and there is a cholera outbreak in the area, administer an antibiotic for cholera</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_referer_diarrhee_deshyd_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRHEA WITH SEVERE DEHYDRATION**\n* Urgently transfer to the hospital, with the mother frequently giving sips of ORS on the way\n* Advise the mother to continue breastfeeding\n* Provide fluids for severe dehydration (Plan C)\n* If the child is 2 years or older and there is a cholera outbreak in the area, administer an antibiotic for cholera</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-37v729.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRHEA WITH SEVERE DEHYDRATION**\n* Urgently transfer to the hospital, with the mother frequently giving sips of ORS on the way\n* Advise the mother to continue breastfeeding\n* Provide fluids for severe dehydration (Plan C)\n* If the child is 2 years or older and there is a cholera outbreak in the area, administer an antibiotic for cholera</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/diarrhees/label_referer_diarrhee_persitante_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE PERSISTENT DIARRHEA**\n* Treat dehydration before transferring, unless the child has another severe classification\n* Transfer to the hospital</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE PERSISTENT DIARRHEA**\n* Treat dehydration before transferring, unless the child has another severe classification\n* Transfer to the hospital</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud-label\">\n            <value>CORPS CHAUD</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/corps_chaud-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have a warm body?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/corps_chaud-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/corps_chaud-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/nombre_jour_corps_chaud-label\">\n            <value>Number of days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/fievre_presente_7_jour-label\">\n            <value>Has the fever been present during the <output value=\"/data/prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/nombre_jour_corps_chaud\"/> days?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/fievre_presente_7_jour-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/fievre_presente_7_jour-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/tdr_disponible-label\">\n            <value>Do you have RDTs?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/tdr_disponible-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/tdr_disponible-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/voyager_zone_risquee-label\">\n            <value>Has the child traveled to a high-risk area in the past 2 months?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/voyager_zone_risquee-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/voyager_zone_risquee-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/tdr_paludisme-label\">\n            <value>Conducting Malaria RDT.</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/tdr_paludisme-tdr_positif-label\">\n            <value>Positive RDT</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/tdr_paludisme-tdr_negatif-label\">\n            <value>Negative RDT</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group-label\">\n            <value>**SIGNS TO CHECK**</value><value form=\"markdown\">**SIGNS TO CHECK**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/signes-label\">\n            <value>Signs</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/signes-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/signes-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/raideur_nuque-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have neck stiffness?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/raideur_nuque-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/raideur_nuque-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/nez_coule-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have a runny nose?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/nez_coule-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/nez_coule-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/cause_palu-label\">\n            <value>Has the child been exposed to another cause of malaria?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/cause_palu-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/signe_gravite_group/cause_palu-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-MALADIE F\u00c9BRILE TR\u00c8S GRAVE**\n* Administer artesunate or quinine (first dose) for severe malaria if RDT(+)\n* Administer the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Administer a dose of paracetamol at the health center if the fever is high (38.5\u00b0C or above)\n* Transfer URGENTLY to the hospital</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MALADIE F\u00c9BRILE TR\u00c8S GRAVE**\n* Administer artesunate or quinine (first dose) for severe malaria if RDT(+)\n* Administer the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Administer a dose of paracetamol at the health center if the fever is high (38.5\u00b0C or above)\n* Transfer URGENTLY to the hospital</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/corps_chaud/label_diag_pneumonie-label\">\n            <value>### **-MALARIA**\n* Administer the recommended first-line oral antimalarial\n* Administer a dose of paracetamol at the health center if the fever is high (38.5\u00b0C or above)\n* Administer appropriate antibiotic treatment if the fever has an identified bacterial cause\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review the child in 3 days if the fever persists\n* If the fever has been present every day for more than 7 days, transfer for further evaluation</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MALARIA**\n* Administer the recommended first-line oral antimalarial\n* Administer a dose of paracetamol at the health center if the fever is high (38.5\u00b0C or above)\n* Administer appropriate antibiotic treatment if the fever has an identified bacterial cause\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review the child in 3 days if the fever persists\n* If the fever has been present every day for more than 7 days, transfer for further evaluation</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/pal-label\">\n            <value>PALLOR</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/pal/paleur_palmaire-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have palmar pallor?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/pal/paleur_palmaire-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/pal/paleur_palmaire-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole-label\">\n            <value>MEASLES</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/eruption_generalisee-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have a generalized rash?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/eruption_generalisee-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/eruption_generalisee-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/l_enfant_prsente-t-il_un_coulement_nasal-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have nasal discharge?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/l_enfant_prsente-t-il_un_coulement_nasal-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/l_enfant_prsente-t-il_un_coulement_nasal-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/rougeole_3_derniers_mois-label\">\n            <value>Has the child had measles in the last 3 months?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/rougeole_3_derniers_mois-oui-label\">\n            <value>yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/rougeole_3_derniers_mois-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/l_enfant_a-t-il_les_yeux_rouges-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have red eyes?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/l_enfant_a-t-il_les_yeux_rouges-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/rougeole/l_enfant_a-t-il_les_yeux_rouges-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille-label\">\n            <value>DOULEUR OREILLE</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/probleme_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have an ear problem?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/probleme_oreille-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/probleme_oreille-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/mal_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have ear pain?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/mal_oreille-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/mal_oreille-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/pus_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have pus draining from an ear?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/pus_oreille-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/pus_oreille-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/nombre_jour_ecoulement_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Number of days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/gonflement_oreille-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have a painful swelling behind the ear?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/gonflement_oreille-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/gonflement_oreille-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/label_diag_pas_infection-label\">\n            <value>### **-NO EAR INFECTION**\n* No treatment</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-NO EAR INFECTION**\n* No treatment</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/label_diag_infection_chronique_oreille-label\">\n            <value>### **-CHRONIC EAR INFECTION**\n* Dry the ear using a wick\n* Treat with topical quinolone ear drops for 14 days\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review the child in 5 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-CHRONIC EAR INFECTION**\n* Dry the ear using a wick\n* Treat with topical quinolone ear drops for 14 days\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review the child in 5 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/label_diag_infection_aigue_oreille-label\">\n            <value>### **-ACUTE EAR INFECTION**\n* **Give an antibiotic for 5 days**\n* **Give paracetamol to relieve pain**\n* Dry the ear using a wick\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review the child in 5 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-ACUTE EAR INFECTION**\n* **Give an antibiotic for 5 days**\n* **Give paracetamol to relieve pain**\n* Dry the ear using a wick\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Review the child in 5 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/douleur_oreille/label_referer_mastoide-label\">\n            <value>### **-MASTOIDITIS**\n* Give the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Give the first dose of paracetamol to relieve pain\n* URGENTLY transfer to the hospital</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MASTOIDITIS**\n* Give the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Give the first dose of paracetamol to relieve pain\n* URGENTLY transfer to the hospital</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition-label\">\n            <value>MALNUTRITION</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb-label\">\n            <value>MUAC measurement (Mid-Upper Arm Circumference)</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb-absence_bandelette-label\">\n            <value>Absence of strip</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb-vert-label\">\n            <value>Green</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb-jaune-label\">\n            <value>Yellow</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/mesure_pb-rouge-label\">\n            <value>Red</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/oedeme-label\">\n            <value>Edema?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/oedeme-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/oedeme-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/amaigrissement_visible-label\">\n            <value>The child shows visible and severe weight loss?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/amaigrissement_visible-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/amaigrissement_visible-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/pb-label\">\n            <value>Mid-upper arm circumference (in mm):</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/pb-constraintMsg\">\n            <value>### The MUAC should be between 50 and 200 mm!</value><value form=\"markdown\">### The MUAC should be between 50 and 200 mm!</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure-label\">\n            <value>Weight Procedure</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/weight_label-label\">\n            <value>Before weighing the child:\n\n* Prepare the weighing process.\n* Tare the scale.\n* Weigh the children one by one.</value><value form=\"markdown\">Before weighing the child:\n\n* Prepare the weighing process.\n* Tare the scale.\n* Weigh the children one by one.</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/weight_label-help\">\n            <value># Technique de pes\u00e9e:\n\n1. Suspendez la balance (Salter).\n\n2. Veillez \u00e0 ce que l\u2019aiguille de la balance soit bien align\u00e9e sur le z\u00e9ro.\n\n3. Suspendez la culotte et ramenez l\u2019aiguille de la balance sur le z\u00e9ro.\n\n4. Enlevez tous les habits du b\u00e9b\u00e9.\n\n5. Utilisez une culotte pour les enfants capables de tenir leur t\u00eate droite et un hamac pour les nourrissons.\n\n6. Mettez la culotte au b\u00e9b\u00e9 en l\u2019enfilant d\u2019abord sur ses jambes puis en passant la courroie de la culotte autour du b\u00e9b\u00e9.\n\n7. Suspendez l\u2019enfant au crochet de la balance au moyen de la culotte. Expliquez \u00e0 la m\u00e8re la proc\u00e9dure de pesage et toutes les pr\u00e9cautions \u00e0 prendre.\n\n8. Demandez \u00e0 la m\u00e8re de bien tenir le b\u00e9b\u00e9.</value><value form=\"markdown\"># Technique de pes\u00e9e:\n\n1. Suspendez la balance (Salter).\n\n2. Veillez \u00e0 ce que l\u2019aiguille de la balance soit bien align\u00e9e sur le z\u00e9ro.\n\n3. Suspendez la culotte et ramenez l\u2019aiguille de la balance sur le z\u00e9ro.\n\n4. Enlevez tous les habits du b\u00e9b\u00e9.\n\n5. Utilisez une culotte pour les enfants capables de tenir leur t\u00eate droite et un hamac pour les nourrissons.\n\n6. Mettez la culotte au b\u00e9b\u00e9 en l\u2019enfilant d\u2019abord sur ses jambes puis en passant la courroie de la culotte autour du b\u00e9b\u00e9.\n\n7. Suspendez l\u2019enfant au crochet de la balance au moyen de la culotte. Expliquez \u00e0 la m\u00e8re la proc\u00e9dure de pesage et toutes les pr\u00e9cautions \u00e0 prendre.\n\n8. Demandez \u00e0 la m\u00e8re de bien tenir le b\u00e9b\u00e9.</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/weight-label\">\n            <value>Weigh the child and record their weight in (Kgs):</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/weight-m2xkey.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">Weigh the child and record their weight in (Kgs):</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/weight-hint\">\n            <value>Tarez la balance salter \u00e0 chaque fois que vous allez peser un enfant</value><value form=\"markdown\">Tarez la balance salter \u00e0 chaque fois que vous allez peser un enfant</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/height-label\">\n            <value>Measure the child and record their height in (cm):</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/height-a8r5od.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">Measure the child and record their height in (cm):</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/weight_procedure/height-hint\">\n            <value>Tarez la balance salter \u00e0 chaque fois que vous allez peser un enfant</value><value form=\"markdown\">Tarez la balance salter \u00e0 chaque fois que vous allez peser un enfant</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/show_zscore_classification-label\">\n            <value>Classification</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/show_zscore_classification/label_zscore-label\">\n            <value>* The child's z score is: <output value=\"/data/var/z_score\"/>: **<output value=\"/data/var/classement_de_score_z\"/>**</value><value form=\"markdown\">* The child's z score is: <output value=\"/data/var/z_score\"/>: **<output value=\"/data/var/classement_de_score_z\"/>**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication-label\">\n            <value>Sign of complication</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication/incapable_finir_apte-label\">\n            <value>Unable to complete the MUAC?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication/incapable_finir_apte-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication/incapable_finir_apte-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication/probleme_allaitement-label\">\n            <value>Breastfeeding problem?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication/probleme_allaitement-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/signe_de_complication/probleme_allaitement-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/label_referer_malnutrition_severe_complication-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE ACUTE MALNUTRITION WITH COMPLICATIONS**\n* Administer the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm\n* Transfer URGENTLY to the hospital</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-37v729.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE ACUTE MALNUTRITION WITH COMPLICATIONS**\n* Administer the first dose of appropriate antibiotics\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm\n* Transfer URGENTLY to the hospital</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/label_diag_malnutrition_severe_sans_complication-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE ACUTE MALNUTRITION WITHOUT COMPLICATIONS**\n* Administer oral antibiotics for 5 days\n* Provide ready-to-use therapeutic food if the child is 6 months or older\n* Advise the mother on the child's feeding\n* Screen for possible tuberculosis infection\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow-up in 7 days</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie-gtu6vm.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE ACUTE MALNUTRITION WITHOUT COMPLICATIONS**\n* Administer oral antibiotics for 5 days\n* Provide ready-to-use therapeutic food if the child is 6 months or older\n* Advise the mother on the child's feeding\n* Screen for possible tuberculosis infection\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow-up in 7 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/label_diag_malnutrition_aigue-label\">\n            <value>### **-MODERATE ACUTE MALNUTRITION**\n* Assess the child's feeding and explain feeding recommendations to the mother\n* In case of feeding problems, follow up in 7 days\n* Screen for possible tuberculosis infection\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow up in 30 days</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie-gtu6vm.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-MODERATE ACUTE MALNUTRITION**\n* Assess the child's feeding and explain feeding recommendations to the mother\n* In case of feeding problems, follow up in 7 days\n* Screen for possible tuberculosis infection\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* Follow up in 30 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/malnutrition/label_pas_malnutrition_aigue-label\">\n            <value>### **-TSY MISY FANJAVONAN-KELOKA MAIKA**\n* If the child is under 2 years old, assess the child's feeding and explain feeding recommendations to the mother\n* In case of feeding problems, follow up in 7 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-TSY MISY FANJAVONAN-KELOKA MAIKA**\n* If the child is under 2 years old, assess the child's feeding and explain feeding recommendations to the mother\n* In case of feeding problems, follow up in 7 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie-label\">\n            <value>ANEMIA</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/paleur_palmaire-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have palmar pallor?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/paleur_palmaire-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/paleur_palmaire-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/severe_paleur_palmaire-label\">\n            <value>Is the pallor severe?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/severe_paleur_palmaire-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/severe_paleur_palmaire-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/drepanocytaire-label\">\n            <value>Ask: Is the child sickle cell anemic?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/drepanocytaire-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/drepanocytaire-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE ANEMIA**\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm\n* Transfer URGENTLY to the hospital</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-37v729.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE ANEMIA**\n* Treat the child to prevent hypoglycemia\n* Keep the child warm\n* Transfer URGENTLY to the hospital</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/label_diag_pneumonie-label\">\n            <value>### **-ANEMIA**\n* Give iron\n* Administer albendazole if the child is at least 1 year old and has not received a dose in the last 6 months\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* If the child has sickle cell anemia, refer for follow-up of their condition\n* Review in 14 days</value><value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/data/prise_en_charge/toux_difficultes_respiratoires/label_diag_pneumonie-gtu6vm.png</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-ANEMIA**\n* Give iron\n* Administer albendazole if the child is at least 1 year old and has not received a dose in the last 6 months\n* Explain to the mother when to return immediately\n* If the child has sickle cell anemia, refer for follow-up of their condition\n* Review in 14 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/anemie/label_diag_toux-label\">\n            <value>### **-NO ANEMIA**\n* If the child is under 2 years old, assess the child's nutrition and explain feeding recommendations to the mother\n* In case of feeding problems, review in 5 days</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-NO ANEMIA**\n* If the child is under 2 years old, assess the child's nutrition and explain feeding recommendations to the mother\n* In case of feeding problems, review in 5 days</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih-label\">\n            <value>HIV</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_vih-label\">\n            <value>Has the mother or the child undergone an HIV test?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_vih-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_vih-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_serologique_mere_connu-label\">\n            <value>Is the mother's serological status known?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_serologique_mere_connu-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_serologique_mere_connu-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_serologique_mere_resultat-label\">\n            <value>What is the mother's serological status?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_serologique_mere_resultat-positif-label\">\n            <value>Positive</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_serologique_mere_resultat-negatif-label\">\n            <value>Negative</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_virologique_enfant_connu-label\">\n            <value>Is the result of the child's virological test known?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_virologique_enfant_connu-oui-label\">\n            <value>Oui</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_virologique_enfant_connu-non-label\">\n            <value>Non</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_virologique_de_enfant-label\">\n            <value>What is the child's virological test result?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_virologique_de_enfant-positif-label\">\n            <value>Positif</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/vih/test_virologique_de_enfant-negatif-label\">\n            <value>Negatif</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/Vaccination-label\">\n            <value>Vaccination</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/Vaccination/carnet_vaccinal-label\">\n            <value>Does the child have a vaccination card?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/Vaccination/carnet_vaccinal-oui-label\">\n            <value>Yes</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/Vaccination/carnet_vaccinal-non-label\">\n            <value>No</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/Vaccination/etat_vaccinal-label\">\n            <value>Is the child up to date with their vaccines?</value></text>\n          <text id=\"prise_en_charge/Vaccination