ATION</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference-label\">\n            <value>REFERENCE MESSAGE</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/image_reference-label\">\n            <value>**PLEASE REFER THE PATIENT IMMEDIATELY!!!**</value><value form=\"markdown\">**PLEASE REFER THE PATIENT IMMEDIATELY!!!**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/motifs-label\">\n            <value>REASON(S) :</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/copy-2-of-label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-VERY SEVERE FEBRILE ILLNESS**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-VERY SEVERE FEBRILE ILLNESS**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/un_signe_de_danger_a_t_dtect_veuillez_rfrer_le_patient_immdiatement-label\">\n            <value>### **One or more danger signs detected!!**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **One or more danger signs detected!!**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_diag_pneumonie_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE PNEUMONIA OR VERY SEVERE DISEASE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE PNEUMONIA OR VERY SEVERE DISEASE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_diarrhee_deshyd_legere-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRH\u00c9E AVEC D\u00c9SHYDRATATION L\u00c9G\u00c8RE**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRH\u00c9E AVEC D\u00c9SHYDRATATION L\u00c9G\u00c8RE**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_diarrhee_deshyd_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-DIARRHEA WITH MILD DEHYDRATION**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-DIARRHEA WITH MILD DEHYDRATION**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_reference/label_referer_diarrhee_persitante_severe-label\">\n            <value>### **-SEVERE PERSISTENT DIARRHEA**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **-SEVERE PERSISTENT DIARRHEA**</value></text>\n          <text id=\"message_de_referen