t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/informations_de_base/age_en_annee_sassie-constraintMsg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Warning! The age of the CHW must be greater than 15 years</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value form=\"markdown\">Warning! The age of the CHW must be greater than 15 years</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>D\u00e9tails de contact</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact/numero_telephone_ac-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>What is your phone number?</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact/numero_telephone_ac-constraintMsg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>WARNING! Phone number must contain 10 digits, no spaces, and starts with 0</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact/adresse-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Adress</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact/personne_de_contact_durgence-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Emergency contact person</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact/numeros_de_telephone_de_la_personne_de_contact_durgence-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Phone number(s) of the emergency contact person</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/dtails_de_contact/numeros_de_telephone_de_la_personne_de_contact_durgence-constraintMsg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>WARNING! Phone number must contain 10 digits, no spaces, and starts with 0</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Card National Identity</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/type_de_piece_didentite-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Type of identification document</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/type_de_piece_didentite-passeport-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>PASSEPORT</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/type_de_piece_didentite-cart_didentit_national_cni-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>National Identity Card (NIC)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/numro_de_piece_didentite-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Identity Card National Number</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/recto_photo_cin-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Take a photo of the ID (Front Side)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/recto_photo_cin-help\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### PHOTO TAKING GUIDELINES\n* Image must be clear (no reflection of the sun - not in a dark place)\n* Frame the image well\n* Take the whole document\n* Adapt the position of the camera so that the document is readable (not too far away and the image should not be blurry)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value form=\"image\">jr://file/commcare/image/help/data/grp_identity/photo_cin-vb5wi5.png</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value form=\"markdown\">### PHOTO TAKING GUIDELINES\n* Image must be clear (no reflection of the sun - not in a dark place)\n* Frame the image well\n* Take the whole document\n* Adapt the position of the camera so that the document is readable (not too far away and the image should not be blurry)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/verso_photo_cin-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Take a photo of the ID (Back Side)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/verso_photo_cin-help\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### PHOTO TAKING GUIDELINES\n* Image must be clear (no reflection of the sun - not in a dark place)\n* Frame the image well\n* Take the whole document\n* Adapt the position of the camera so that the document is readable (not too far away and the image should not be blurry)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value form=\"markdown\">### PHOTO TAKING GUIDELINES\n* Image must be clear (no reflection of the sun - not in a dark place)\n* Frame the image well\n* Take the whole document\n* Adapt the position of the camera so that the document is readable (not too far away and the image should not be blurry)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/expiration_date_id_card-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Delivery date of the ID</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/grp_identity/expiration_date_id_card-constraintMsg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>The CIN expiration date must not be earlier than 10 years before today.</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/photo_ac-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Photo of the Community Agent (CA)</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/photo_ac/photo-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Front-facing photo of the agent</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/photo_ac/photo-hint\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>This refers to a photograph of an agent or representative (such as a security guard, official, employee, staff, or any designated person), usually taken for identification or professional purposes. It is typically a passport-style photo showing the face and shoulders, taken from the front.</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/photo_ac/photo-help\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### WORKER PHOTO GUIDELINES\n\n* Take well-framed photos of the face just like ID photos\n* Enough light, neither too dark nor too bright.\n* Face photo\n* Without glasses, hat ...</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value form=\"markdown\">### WORKER PHOTO GUIDELINES\n\n* Take well-framed photos of the face just like ID photos\n* Enough light, neither too dark nor too bright.\n* Face photo\n* Without glasses, hat ...</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/consent-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Consent</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/consent/consent_label-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>## By signing this document, I confirm that:\n* I consent to being contacted by phone for follow-ups related to my activities as a CHW.\n* I consent to my data being stored in CommCare, managed by **DIMAGI**, and used exclusively for data collection by ONN/U-PNNC.\n* I understand that I can withdraw my consent at any time by contacting **ONN/U-PNNC**.\n* I certify that the information provided is accurate.</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value form=\"markdown\">## By signing this document, I confirm that:\n* I consent to being contacted by phone for follow-ups related to my activities as a CHW.\n* I consent to my data being stored in CommCare, managed by **DIMAGI**, and used exclusively for data collection by ONN/U-PNNC.\n* I understand that I can withdraw my consent at any time by contacting **ONN/U-PNNC**.\n* I certify that the information provided is accurate.</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/consent/signature-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>CHW Signature</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"enregistrement_des_acs/agen_non_existant/vars_info-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>vars_info</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"grp_summary-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>Summary</value>\n\t\t\t\t\t</text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"grp_summary/label_resume_1-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>## Summary\n\n|Name 