ra \u00ab 0 \u00bb. Mety ho eo ambony na ho eo\nambanin\u2019ny zotra \u00ab 0 \u00bb izy amin\u2019izany.\n\n\u2022 Tsy maintsy hadihadiana ny fiovana tampoka izay miseho\neo amin\u2019ny zotran\u2019ny zaza iray, itiliana sy hanarenana izay\nolana mety nitranga.</value><value form=\"markdown\">###  **Famakafakana ny tabilao**\n\n\u2022 Ny bikan\u2019ny zotra ho an\u2019ny zaza mitombo ara-dal\u00e0na, dia\nmanahaka ny zotra \u00ab 0 \u00bb. Mety ho eo ambony na ho eo\nambanin\u2019ny zotra \u00ab 0 \u00bb izy amin\u2019izany.\n\n\u2022 Tsy maintsy hadihadiana ny fiovana tampoka izay miseho\neo amin\u2019ny zotran\u2019ny zaza iray, itiliana sy hanarenana izay\nolana mety nitranga.</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"famakafakana_ny_tabilao__ny_zotra_manana_bika_marindrano_dia_midika_fa_tsy_-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Famakafakana ny tabilao**\n\n\u2022 Ny zotra manana bika marindrano dia midika fa tsy\nmitombo ny zaza\n\n\u2022 Tokony ho malina ary hanadihady ny mpandanja raha\nmanapaka ny zotra hafa (2, 1, 0, -1, -2, -3) ny zotran\u2019ny zaza\nlanjaina</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Famakafakana ny tabilao**\n\n\u2022 Ny zotra manana bika marindrano dia midika fa tsy\nmitombo ny zaza\n\n\u2022 Tokony ho malina ary hanadihady ny mpandanja raha\nmanapaka ny zotra hafa (2, 1, 0, -1, -2, -3) ny zotran\u2019ny zaza\nlanjaina</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fepetra_tokony_ho_raisina_arakaraka_ny_valinny_famakafakana_mlg-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Fepetra tokony ho raisina arakaraka ny valin\u2019ny famakafakana**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Fepetra tokony ho raisina arakaraka ny valin\u2019ny famakafakana**</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"torohevitra_aminny_fanarahana_ny_sakafonny_zaza_ataovy_ara-dalna_ny_sakafon-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Torohevitra amin\u2019ny fanarahana ny sakafon\u2019ny zaza**\n\n**Ataovy ara-dal\u00e0na ny sakafon\u2019ny zaza:**\n\n\u2022 Vao teraka ka hatramin\u2019ny 6 volana: fampinonoan-