n\t\t\t<bind vellum:nodeset=\"#form/torohevitra_efa_hita_tao_aminny_lohahevitra_a__taranja_1_ireto_-_ny_fanaova\" nodeset=\"/data/torohevitra_efa_hita_tao_aminny_lohahevitra_a__taranja_1_ireto_-_ny_fanaova\"/>\n\t\t\t<bind vellum:nodeset=\"#form/fambara_loza_mandritra_ny_fitondrana_vohoka__vono_ratra__mibinabina_indrind\" nodeset=\"/data/fambara_loza_mandritra_ny_fitondrana_vohoka__vono_ratra__mibinabina_indrind\"/>\n\t\t\t<bind vellum:nodeset=\"#form/misaotra__mlg\" nodeset=\"/data/misaotra__mlg\"/>\n\t\t\t<itext>\n\t\t\t\t<translation lang=\"fra\" default=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"lohahevitra_g__fampiroboroboana_ny_fandraisana_antnana_manodidina_ny_fitera-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>###  **Lohahevitra G : Fampiroboroboana ny fandraisana an-t\u00e0nana manodidina ny fiterahana**\n\n\nTaranja 1 : Fanaraha-maso ny vehivavy bevohoka</value><value form=\"markdown\">###  **Lohahevitra G : Fampiroboroboana ny fandraisana an-t\u00e0nana manodidina ny fiterahana**\n\n\nTaranja 1 : Fanaraha-maso ny vehivavy bevohoka</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"famaritana_ny_fitondrana_vohoka_12_famaritana_ny_fitondrana_vohoka_na_ny_ho-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Famaritana ny fitondrana vohoka (1/2)**\n\n**Famaritana ny fitondrana vohoka na ny hoe \u00abMitoe-jaza\u00bb**\n\n\u2022Atao hoe **\u201cMitoe-jaza na bevohoka\u201d** ny vehivavy iray\nrehefa tsy tonga ny fadim-bolany tao aorian\u2019ny firaisana ara-nofo ary voamarina tamin\u2019ny ny fitiliana (test de grossesse)\nizany.</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Famaritana ny fitondrana vohoka (1/2)**\n\n**Famaritana ny fitondrana vohoka na ny hoe \u00abMitoe-jaza\u00bb**\n\n\u2022Atao hoe **\u201cMitoe-jaza na bevohoka\u201d** ny vehivavy iray\nrehefa tsy tonga ny fadim-bolany tao aorian\u2019ny firaisana ara-nofo ary voamarina tamin\u2019ny ny fitiliana (test de grossesse)\nizany.</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fahalalana_fototra_mikasika_ny_fisafoana_22_ireo_fambara_na_fiovana_mety_hi-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Fahalalana fototra mikasika ny fisafoana (2/2)**\n\nIreo fambara na fiovana mety hiseho amin\u2019ny vehivavy\nmitoe-jaza :\n\n\u2022maloiloy, mandoa, tsy tia fofona na sakafo. . .\n\n\u2022lasa kizitina , kamokamo, rera-dava, be\ntorimaso,sns. .\n\n\u2022mihamahazo lanja izy ary mitombo ny kibony</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Fahalalana fototra mikasika ny fisafoana (2/2)**\n\nIreo fambara na fiovana mety hiseho amin\u2019ny vehivavy\nmitoe-jaza :\n\n\u2022maloiloy, mandoa, tsy tia fofona na sakafo. . .\n\n\u2022lasa kizitina , kamokamo, rera-dava, be\ntorimaso,sns. .\n\n\u2022mihamahazo lanja izy ary mitombo ny kibony</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"ireo_tolotra_omena_ny_reny_bevohoka_eny_aminny_toby_fafy_fitiliana_ny_vohok-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Ireo tolotra omena ny reny bevohoka eny amin\u2019ny toby FAFY:**\n\n\u2022Fitiliana ny vohoka\n\n\u2022Fitiliana ny fanjariantsakafo: refi-tsandry, lanja, counseiling,\nVAD\n\n\u2022Dinidinika fanabeazana sy fampianarana nahandro\n\n\u2022fanentanana hisitraka ny tolotra eny amin\u2019ny\ntobimpahasalamana</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Ireo tolotra omena ny reny bevohoka eny amin\u2019ny toby FAFY:**\n\n\u2022Fitiliana ny vohoka\n\n\u2022Fitiliana ny fanjariantsakafo: refi-tsandry, lanja, counseiling,\nVAD\n\n\u2022Dinidinika fanabeazana sy fampianarana nahandro\n\n\u2022fanentanana hisitraka ny tolotra eny amin\u2019ny\ntobimpahasalamana</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fitiliana_vohoka_test_de_grossesse15_famaritana_ny_fitiliana_vohoka_na_test-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Fitiliana vohoka \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d(1/5)**\n\n**Famaritana**\n\nNy fitiliana vohoka na \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d dia\nahafahana mamantatra na bevohoka na tsia ny\nvehivavy iray 10 andro aorian\u2019ny fitsaihana</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Fitiliana vohoka \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d(1/5)**\n\n**Famaritana**\n\nNy fitiliana vohoka na \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d dia\nahafahana mamantatra na bevohoka na tsia ny\nvehivavy iray 10 andro aorian\u2019ny fitsaihana</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fitiliana_vohoka_test_de_grossesse25_fotoana_fampiasana_azy_rehefa_avy_mana-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Fitiliana vohoka \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d(2/5)**\n\n**Fotoana fampiasana azy**\n\nRehefa avy manatanteraka ny masontsivana nefa mbola manana ahiahy\namin'ny fandraisana fanapahan-kevitra momba ila y vehiva vy sao bevohoka\nihany izy dia ampiasaina ny fitiliana vohoka mba ahafahana mamantatra\nmarina ny momba ilay vehivavy.</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Fitiliana vohoka \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d(2/5)**\n\n**Fotoana fampiasana azy**\n\nRehefa avy manatanteraka ny masontsivana nefa mbola manana ahiahy\namin'ny fandraisana fanapahan-kevitra momba ila y vehiva vy sao bevohoka\nihany izy dia ampiasaina ny fitiliana vohoka mba ahafahana mamantatra\nmarina ny momba ilay vehivavy.</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fitiliana_vohoka_test_de_grossesse35_masontsivana_fanamarinana_fitondrana_v-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Fitiliana vohoka \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d(3/5)**\n\n**Masontsivana fanamarinana fitondrana vohoka\nRaha TSIA daholo ny valin-tenin\u2019ilay vehivavy rehefa napetraka taminy ireto fanontaniana 6\nmanaraka ireto dia azo eritreretina fa bevohoka izy.**\n1. Manana zanaka latsaky ny 6-volana sady mampinono tsy misy fangarony ary mbola tsy\nniverina ve ny fadimbolanao?\n2. Mananjanaka kely latsaka ny efatra (4) herinandro ve ianao?\n3. Niteraka tsy tonga volana na afa-jaza ve ianao tao anatin\u2019ny fito andro farany teo?\n4. Nanomboka tao anatin\u2019ny fito andro (7) lasa teo ve ny fadimbolanao farany?\n5. Tsy niray ara-nofo ve ianao taorian\u2019ny fadimbolanao farany?\n6. Mampiasa fomba FF mahomby sy azo antoka ary ara-dal\u00e0na tsara ve ianao?</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Fitiliana vohoka \u201ctest de grossesse\u201d(3/5)**\n\n**Masontsivana fanamarinana fitondrana vohoka\nRaha TS