na isan\u2019andro\nmandritra ny 2 volana\n\n\u2022 **Zaza MAM :** Omena 1 fonosana isan\u2019andro mandra-pahasitrany (tsy\nmihoatra ny 90 andro)\n\n**Fonosana 1 :** zaraina indroa isan\u2019andro no omena plumpy sup ny zaza ,\neo anelanelan\u2019ny sakafo ( @ 10 ora sy @ 3 ora)</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hafatra_ho_anny_reny_isaky_ny_mizara_plumpy_sup__plumpy_sup__fanafody__saka-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2022 Plumpy sup = **fanafody** + sakafo hitsaboana ny zaza MAM irery ihany\n\nTsy azo omena ny zaza salama ary tsy mety hitsaboana ny zaza MAS\n\n\u2022 **Fanampi-tsakafo**\u2794 tsy mahampy ny zaza mandritra ny tontolo andro.\n\n\u2713 Omena sakafo mahazatra in-telo isan\u2019andro ny zaza .\n\n\u2713Anelanelan\u2019ny sakafo no anomezana Plumpy Sup .\n\u2713Laniana anatin\u2019ny iray andro ny Plumpy Sup .\n\u2713Ampitomboina ny fatra-tsakafo</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2022 Plumpy sup = **fanafody** + sakafo hitsaboana ny zaza MAM irery ihany\n\nTsy azo omena ny zaza salama ary tsy mety hitsaboana ny zaza MAS\n\n\u2022 **Fanampi-tsakafo**\u2794 tsy mahampy ny zaza mandritra ny tontolo andro.\n\n\u2713 Omena sakafo mahazatra in-telo isan\u2019andro ny zaza .\n\n\u2713Anelanelan\u2019ny sakafo no anomezana Plumpy Sup .\n\u2713Laniana anatin\u2019ny iray andro ny Plumpy Sup .\n\u2713Ampitomboina ny fatra-tsakafo</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hafatra_ho_anny_reny_isaky_ny_mizara_plumpy_sup_tohizana_hatrany_ny_fampino-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713Tohizana hatrany ny fampinonoan-dreny hatramin\u2019ny faha 2 taona zaza.\n\n\u2713Ampinonoana ny zaza vao omena Plumpy Sup\n\n\u2713Omena rano matetika ny zaza mihinana Plumpy Sup</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713Tohizana hatrany ny fampinonoan-dreny hatramin\u2019ny faha 2 taona zaza.\n\n\u2713Ampinonoana ny zaza vao omena Plumpy Sup\n\n\u2713Omena rano matetika ny zaza mihinana Plumpy Sup</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hafatra_ho_anny_reny_isaky_ny_mizara_plumpy_sup__sasao_madio_aminny_rano_sy-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713 sasao madio amin\u2019ny rano sy savony ny tanana sy ny tarehin\u2019ny zaza alohan\u2019ny\nihinana Plumpy Sup\n\n\u2713 sasana madio amin\u2019ny rano sy savony ny tanan\u2019ny mpamahana ny zaza</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713 sasao madio amin\u2019ny rano sy savony ny tanana sy ny tarehin\u2019ny zaza alohan\u2019ny\nihinana Plumpy Sup\n\n\u2713 sasana madio amin\u2019ny rano sy savony ny tanan\u2019ny mpamahana ny zaza</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hafatra_ho_anny_reny_isaky_ny_mizara_plumpy_sup_vilia_sy_sotro_madio_no_ham-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713Vilia sy Sotro madio no hamahanana ny zaza\n\n\u2713Tehirizo anaty lovia/ boaty madio misarona ny fonosana Plumpy Sup efa nisokatra.\nApetraho amin\u2019ny toerana madio sy maina</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713Vilia sy Sotro madio no hamahanana ny zaza\n\n\u2713Tehirizo anaty lovia/ boaty madio misarona ny fonosana Plumpy Sup efa nisokatra.\nApetraho amin\u2019ny toerana madio sy maina</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hafatra_ho_anny_reny_isaky_ny_mizara_plumpy_sup_tohizana_ny_fanomezana_saka-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713Tohizana ny fanomezana sakafo azy na dia mivalana aza izy\n(sakafo mahazatra sy Plumpy Sup) .\n\n\u2713Entina miverina ny sachet 15 isaky ny 15 andro</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**\n\n\u2713Tohizana ny fanomezana sakafo azy na dia mivalana aza izy\n(sakafo mahazatra sy Plumpy Sup) .\n\n\u2713Entina miverina ny sachet 15 isaky ny 15 andro</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hafatra_ho_anny_reny_isaky_ny_mizara_plumpy_sup_mlg-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **HAFATRA HO AN\u2019NY RENY ISAKY NY MIZARA PLUMPY SUP**</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fandraisana_an-tananaara-pahasalamana__hamarinina_raha_toa_ka_tsy_nahazo_vi-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **7 - FANDRAISANA AN-TANANAARA-PAHASALAMANA**\n\n\u2022 Hamarinina raha toa ka tsy nahazo vit A sy odikankana tao anatin\u2019ny 6 volana\nfarany , sy vita ara-dalana ny vakisiny .\n\n\u27a2Raha tsia , alefa eny amin\u2019ny tobim-pahasalamana</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **7 - FANDRAISANA AN-TANANAARA-PAHASALAMANA**\n\n\u2022 Hamarinina raha toa ka tsy nahazo vit A sy odikankana tao anatin\u2019ny 6 volana\nfarany , sy vita ara-dalana ny vakisiny .\n\n\u27a2Raha tsia , alefa eny amin\u2019ny tobim-pahasalamana</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"fanaraha-maso_ireo_zaza_raisina_antanana_eny_aminny_crenam_harahana_maso_en-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **8- FANARAHA-MASO IREO ZAZA RAISINA ANTANANA ENY AMIN\u2019NY CRENAM**\n\nHarahana maso eny @ toby isa-tapabolana ny zaza.\n\n\u2751Alaina ny refi-tsandriny : jerena raha efa hivoaka ny CRENAM ( 125mm)\nna ihany koa tokony halefa CRENAS ( Latsaky ny 115mm)\n\n\u2751Jerena sao misy fivontosana ny zaza \u2794 Alefa avy hatrany eny @ tobim-pahasalamana\n\n\u2751Lanjaina ny zaza ary ampitahaina @ lanjany teo aloha\n\n\u2751Jerena raha misy ireo fepetran\u2019ny tsy fahombiazana ny fitsaboana</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **8- FANARAHA-MASO IREO ZAZA RAISINA ANTANANA ENY AMIN\u2019NY CRENAM**\n\nHarahana maso eny @ toby isa-tapabolana ny zaza.\n\n\u2751Alaina ny refi-tsandriny : jerena raha efa hivoaka ny CRENAM ( 125mm)\nna ihan