ny_mampinono_sy_ireo_tokony_ho_fadiana_22_mahak\" nodeset=\"/data/ireo_torohevitra_omena_ny_reny_mampinono_sy_ireo_tokony_ho_fadiana_22_mahak\"/>\n\t\t\t<bind vellum:nodeset=\"#form/misaotra__mlg\" nodeset=\"/data/misaotra__mlg\"/>\n\t\t\t<itext>\n\t\t\t\t<translation lang=\"fra\" default=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"lohahevitra_a__sakafonny_vehivavy_taranja_2_sakafo_sahaza_ny_reny_mampinono-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Lohahevitra A : Sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy**\n\n**Taranja 2: Sakafo sahaza ny reny mampinono**</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Lohahevitra A : Sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy**\n\n**Taranja 2: Sakafo sahaza ny reny mampinono**</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"taranja_2_sakafo_sahaza_ny_reny_mampinono_ho_rera-dava_sy_ho_farofy_ny_reny-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Taranja 2: Sakafo sahaza ny reny mampinono**\n\nHo rera-dava sy ho farofy ny reny mampinono raha tsy miovaova sy tsy ara-pahasalamana ny sakafony</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Taranja 2: Sakafo sahaza ny reny mampinono**\n\nHo rera-dava sy ho farofy ny reny mampinono raha tsy miovaova sy tsy ara-pahasalamana ny sakafony</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"tombontsoa_azonny_reny_mampinono_avy_aminny_sakafo_ampy_sy_voalanjalanja__m-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Tombontsoa azon\u2019ny reny mampinono avy amin\u2019ny sakafo ampy sy voalanjalanja**\n\n\u2022 Miantoka ny hery lany amin\u2019ny fampinonoana ny fihinanan\u2019ny reny sakafo mihoatra ny mahazatra, miovaova, voalanjalanja ary be singa mpamelona.\n\n\u2022 Afaka mampinono tsara ny zanany ny reny voatohana ara-tsakafo.</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Tombontsoa azon\u2019ny reny mampinono avy amin\u2019ny sakafo ampy sy voalanjalanja**\n\n\u2022 Miantoka ny hery lany amin\u2019ny fampinonoana ny fihinanan\u2019ny reny sakafo mihoatra ny mahazatra, miovaova, voalanjalanja ary be singa mpamelona.\n\n\u2022 Afaka mampinono tsara ny zanany ny reny voatohana ara-tsakafo.</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_sakafonny_vehivavy_mampinono_14_vanim-potoananny_-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (1/4)**\n\n**Vanim-potoanan\u2019ny fampinonoana :**\n\n\u2022 Mandritran\u2019ny fampinonoana no tena mila hery ny vehivavy\n\n\u2022 Miakatra ny filany vitaminina sy mineraly</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (1/4)**\n\n**Vanim-potoanan\u2019ny fampinonoana :**\n\n\u2022 Mandritran\u2019ny fampinonoana no tena mila hery ny vehivavy\n\n\u2022 Miakatra ny filany vitaminina sy mineraly</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_sakafonny_vehivavy_mampinono_24_ampio_ny_sakafo_i-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (2/4)**\n\nAmpio ny sakafo isan\u2019andro hanana tahirin-kery ho fanoanana ny fampinonoana:\n\n\u208b 6 volana voalohany : miampy sakafo iray ary miampy fatra iray mihoatra\nny mahazatra isan\u2019andro.\n\n\u208b 6 ka hatramin\u2019ny 12 volana : miampy sakafo iray isan\u2019andro.\n\n\u208b Ovaovao ny sakafo arak\u2019izay misy eo am-pelatanana</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (2/4)**\n\nAmpio ny sakafo isan\u2019andro hanana tahirin-kery ho fanoanana ny fampinonoana:\n\n\u208b 6 volana voalohany : miampy sakafo iray ary miampy fatra iray mihoatra\nny mahazatra isan\u2019andro.\n\n\u208b 6 ka hatramin\u2019ny 12 volana : miampy sakafo iray isan\u2019andro.\n\n\u208b Ovaovao ny sakafo arak\u2019izay misy eo am-pelatanana</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_sakafonny_vehivavy_mampinono_34__hatsarao_aminny_-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (3/4)**\n\n\u2022 Hatsarao amin\u2019ny karazan-tsakafo be fer (toy ny hena, trondro lena na maina, atody,\nvoanjo, voamaina isan-karazany, voaloboka) sy be vitamina A (manga, papay,\nanana miloko maitso, matroka, legioma miloko mavo mena toy ny voatavo) sy ny\nsakafo be calcium toy ny ronono sy ny vokatra azo avy aminy , patsa mena, sns. . .\nny foto-tsakafo;\n\n\u2022 Tsy misy ahiana mihitsy ny fihinanana an\u2019ireny mandritra ny fampinonoana.</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (3/4)**\n\n\u2022 Hatsarao amin\u2019ny karazan-tsakafo be fer (toy ny hena, trondro lena na maina, atody,\nvoanjo, voamaina isan-karazany, voaloboka) sy be vitamina A (manga, papay,\nanana miloko maitso, matroka, legioma miloko mavo mena toy ny voatavo) sy ny\nsakafo be calcium toy ny ronono sy ny vokatra azo avy aminy , patsa mena, sns. . .\nny foto-tsakafo;\n\n\u2022 Tsy misy ahiana mihitsy ny fihinanana an\u2019ireny mandritra ny fampinonoana.</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_sakafonny_vehivavy_mampinono_44__misotroa_rano_sy-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (4/4)**\n\n\u2022 Misotroa rano sy ranom-boankazo betsaka\n\n\u2022 Mampias\u00e0 sira misy ioda amin\u2019ny fandrahoana sakafo: ilain\u2019ny zaza eo amin\u2019ny\nfivelaran\u2019ny sainy ny ioda.\n\n\u2022 Mila tohanana ny reny amin\u2019ny asa ao an-tokantrano ary avelao hiala-sasatra\ntsara izy.</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny sakafon\u2019ny vehivavy mampinono (4/4)**\n\n\u2022 Misotroa rano sy ranom-boankazo betsaka\n\n\u2022 Mampias\u00e0 sira misy ioda amin\u2019ny fandrahoana sakafo: ilain\u2019ny zaza eo amin\u2019ny\nfivelaran\u2019ny sainy ny ioda.\n\n\u2022 Mila tohanana ny reny amin\u2019ny asa ao an-tokantrano ary avelao hiala-sasatra\ntsara izy.</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_fahasalamanny_reny_mampinono_12__mahakasika_ny_fa-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (1/2)**\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fandrindrana sy fanelanelanana idealy ny vohoka ho an\u2019ny\nfahasalamana\n\n\u2022 Fampiasana lay misy odimoka maharitra\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fitandremam-pahadiovana (fanasan-t\u00e0nana, fikarakarana\nsakafo sy ny fitaovana ampiasaina)</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (1/2)**\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fandrindrana sy fanelanelanana idealy ny vohoka ho an\u2019ny\nfahasalamana\n\n\u2022 Fampiasana lay misy odimoka maharitra\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fitandremam-pahadiovana (fanasan-t\u00e0nana, fikarakarana\nsakafo sy ny fitaovana ampiasaina)</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_fahasalamanny_reny_mampinono_22__tohizina_ny_fihi-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (2/2)**\n\n\u2022 Tohizina ny fihinana pilifera aorian\u2019ny fiterahana raha tsy tapitra ny fatra tokony\nhohaniny.\n\n\u2022 Fanaraha-maso akaiky ny fahasalamana (fijerena aorian\u2019ny fiterahana)</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (2/2)**\n\n\u2022 Tohizina ny fihinana pilifera aorian\u2019ny fiterahana raha tsy tapitra ny fatra tokony\nhohaniny.\n\n\u2022 Fanaraha-maso akaiky ny fahasalamana (fijerena aorian\u2019ny fiterahana)</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"ireo_torohevitra_omena_ny_reny_mampinono_sy_ireo_tokony_ho_fadiana_12_mahak-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Ireo torohevitra omena ny reny mampinono sy ireo tokony ho fadiana (1/2)**\n\n**Mahakasika ny zaza minono:**\n\n\u2022 Fampinonoana ny zaza amin\u2019ny nonon-dreny fotsiny ihany hatramin\u2019ny faha 6\nvolana\n\n\u2022 fanohizana ny fampinonoan-dreny hatramin\u2019ny faha-2 taonan\u2019ny zaza\nfarafahakeliny\n\n\u2022 Fampidirana ny fanampin-tsakafo ho an\u2019ny zaza manomboka ny faha-6 volana\n\n\u2022 Fanaovana ny vaksiny ny zaza.</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Ireo torohevitra omena ny reny mampinono sy ireo