etsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_fahasalamanny_reny_mampinono_12__mahakasika_ny_fa-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (1/2)**\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fandrindrana sy fanelanelanana idealy ny vohoka ho an\u2019ny\nfahasalamana\n\n\u2022 Fampiasana lay misy odimoka maharitra\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fitandremam-pahadiovana (fanasan-t\u00e0nana, fikarakarana\nsakafo sy ny fitaovana ampiasaina)</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (1/2)**\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fandrindrana sy fanelanelanana idealy ny vohoka ho an\u2019ny\nfahasalamana\n\n\u2022 Fampiasana lay misy odimoka maharitra\n\n\u2022 Mahakasika ny fitandremam-pahadiovana (fanasan-t\u00e0nana, fikarakarana\nsakafo sy ny fitaovana ampiasaina)</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"hetsika_ho_fanatsarana_ny_fahasalamanny_reny_mampinono_22__tohizina_ny_fihi-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (2/2)**\n\n\u2022 Tohizina ny fihinana pilifera aorian\u2019ny fiterahana raha tsy tapitra ny fatra tokony\nhohaniny.\n\n\u2022 Fanaraha-maso akaiky ny fahasalamana (fijerena aorian\u2019ny fiterahana)</value><value form=\"markdown\">### **Hetsika ho fanatsarana ny fahasalaman\u2019ny reny mampinono (2/2)**\n\n\u2022 Tohizina ny fihinana pilifera aorian\u2019ny fiterahana raha tsy tapitra ny fatra tokony\nhohaniny.\n\n\u2022 Fanaraha-maso akaiky ny fahasalamana (fijerena aorian\u2019ny fiterahana)</value></text>\n\t\t\t\t\t<text id=\"ireo_torohevitra_omena_ny_reny_mampinono_sy_ireo_tokony_ho_fadiana_12_mahak-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<value>### **Ireo torohevitra omena ny reny mampinono sy ireo tokony ho fadiana (1/2)**\n\n**Mahakasika ny zaza minono:**\n\n\u2022 Fampinonoana ny zaza amin\u2019ny nonon-dreny fotsiny ihany hatramin\u2019ny faha 6\nvolana\n\n\u2022 fanohizana ny fampinonoan-dreny hatramin\u2019ny faha-2 taonan\u2019ny zaza\nfarafahakeliny\n\n\u20